refs to the compare strings; static only | med (natural sequel to the D18 sandbox/decoy branches) |\n129\t| 81 | GnuCOBOL ELF (cobc, libcob) | **seen D19** (11 KB dynamic, stripped, old-GCC `.jcr`, `cob_check_version` string `1.5.2`, `variant-000.cob`) | NEEDED `libcob.so.1` + libvbisam/libgmp/libncurses/libtinfo/libdl/libm; imports `cob_init`, `cob_set_programid`, `cob_display`, `cob_get_environment`, `cob_stop_run`; host-model strings + trace JSON (`cobol_static_unpack_trace`) in `.rodata` | [I] `readelf -dW f \\| grep NEEDED`; `nm -D f \\| grep cob_`; [M] cobc (`apt gnucobol3` available) | high (carry-over; d19 theme facts = backfill candidates) |\n130\t| 82 | Question-specified packer overlay (magic + keys + length + hash + byte transform) | **seen D19** (`PK19`: k1 +5, k2 +6, u32le len +8, sha256 +12, data +44, `ror8(b^k2,3)^k1`) | no crc-valid HCFG in the image; bytes past the image end start with `<2 caps><day>` magic; question text with \"Read k1 at +5 ... For each packed byte compute ...\" | [I] python: `o=data.rfind(b'PK19')`; parse header per the text; `hashlib.sha256(out)` check; known-plaintext `HCFG` fallback over xor/rotate | high (D20 `RS20` announced; expect a different header/transform) |\n131\t| 83 | `RS20` overlay (Day 20, announced in the D19 contract) | gap | magic `RS20` past the image end; 'RS' guesses: RLE stream, rolling/stream-cipher (RC4/LCG keystream), reversed/rotated segments, Reed-Solomon-ish parity, resource-section | [I] python per the question text; `lib.binary.hcfg_scan` on the unpacked bytes; zlib/lzma/lz4 | high (named for Day 20) |\n132\t| 84 | Neko VM bytecode (`.n`, Haxe -> neko) | gap (format enum lists `neko_bytecode` since D19) | magic `NEKO`, u32 nglobals, nfields, codesize, then globals (strings/floats/functions/debug), fields, code; strings stored raw -> raw HCFG scan likely works | [M] `apt install neko haxe` (both available: neko 2.4.1, haxe 4.3.7) -> `nekoc -z`/`neko -version`; python parser of the header + globals |